        "original_id": "6b4a6576-53f2-5406-9127-f7348adbf0e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donna Freedman, Margot Robbie\n- Works: Neighbours\n- Roles: fictional character, actor\n- Awards: Logie Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Donna Freedman, also known as Donna Brown, is a fictional character from the Australian soap opera Neighbours.\n- Margot Robbie played Donna Freedman in Neighbours.\n- Margot Robbie was cast in Neighbours and appeared in the soap opera from 2008 to 2011.\n- Margot Robbie earned two Logie Award nominations for her work on Neighbours.",
